  "incident_summary": "Windows workstation DESKTOP-GXNYNO2 (192.168.1.216) infected with Emotet/Qbot malware. The malware established persistent HTTP-based C2 communication with 2.56.57.108:80 using repeated POST beacons to /osk/ endpoints. Exfiltrated Chrome autofill credentials and executed remote commands (PowerShell) for lateral movement via TeamViewer installation."
